1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:06,060
I hope you know you make me happy. I know it sounds simple, but I mean it from the heart.

2
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:13,320
A regular day becomes beautiful when I spend it with you. You make me believe in love again.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:21,460
We fight. We make up. We talk. We comfort each other. And in all these little things,

4
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,900
I feel how much love there is.
